    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Impressive & Well located Three Bedroom End of Terrace Residence\r\n\r\nKinsella Estates Gorey are truly delighted to offer to the market this well presented three-bedroom end of terrace residence located in the well-known coastal development of Riverchapel Wood in Riverchapel, Gorey, Co. Wexford. \r\n\r\n\r\nNestled in the charming community of Riverchapel, Co. Wexford, 3 Riverchapel Lawns offers a delightful end of terrace home perfect for family living. This well-maintained property boasts a spacious interior of 94 square meters, complemented by a generous rear garden, ideal for outdoor activities and relaxation.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are greeted by a welcoming hallway, leading to the main living area. The living room is bright and inviting, featuring a stylish fireplace and ample space for comfortable seating, making it the perfect spot for family gatherings.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen and dining area are open and airy, with appliances and plenty of storage. The large sliding doors provide easy access to the rear garden, allowing for seamless indoor-outdoor living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property offers three well-proportioned bedrooms, each with fitted wardrobes and large windows that fill the rooms with natural light. The master bedroom includes an en-suite for added convenience. A family bathroom, complete with a bathtub and modern fixtures, serves the additional bedrooms.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property benefits from a private driveway providing parking for two vehicles. The rear garden is fully enclosed, offering a safe and secure environment for children to play.\r\n\r\nWith a BER rating of C, this home is both energy-efficient and comfortable. Priced at 285,000, 3 Riverchapel Lawns is a fantastic opportunity for those seeking a family home in a peaceful and friendly neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nCourtown is situated on the coast of North County Wexford and boasts some of the best kept and safest beaches in Ireland. The high quality of this development and its pivotal seaside location, under an hour's drive to Dublin makes this an excellent home, investment opportunity or holiday home. \r\n\r\nThe auctioneer highly recommends an early viewing of same.\r\n\r\nBER: C 119649622\r\nHouse Size: 94 sq mt / 1,012 sq ft\r\nEir Code: Y25 V279\r\n\r\n\r\nServices:\r\n•Oil Fired Central Heating\r\n•Mains Sewerage\r\n•Mains Water\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nGround Floor:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall:\r\nTiled Floor \r\nCoving\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room: 5.9m X 3.5m\r\nTiled Floor & Splash Back\r\nChrome Vent\r\nDouble Doors onto Spacious Back Garden and Patio Area\r\n\r\nSitting Room: 4.9m x 3.9m\r\nFeature Timber Fireplace\r\nSolid Fuel Stove\r\nTimber Floor\r\nBay Window\r\nCoving\r\n\r\nWC\r\nTiled Floor & Splash Back\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nLanding:\r\nWith Hot Press\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: 4.6m x 3.4m\r\nBuilt in Wardrobe\r\nTimber Floor\r\nEnsuite Tiled Splash Back's\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 3.7m x 3.2m\r\nBuilt in Wardrobe\r\nTimber Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 2.8m x 2.3m\r\nBuilt in Wardrobe\r\nTimber Floor\r\n\r\nBathroom: 2.9m x 2.1m\r\nTiled Splash Back\r\n\r\nRear of Property:\r\nLow Maintenance Garden \r\nNot Over Looked to the Rear\r\nGarden Shed\r\nDecking Area"
      },
